                            {
                                "example_id": "6eaf5237-f574-4cb6-a272-961eef2be7a6",
                                "sense_id": "6a8a1c75-4e9f-3ce7-aeb7-b0392c2d4177",
                                "text": "[…] but the beleuers of this oure late reformed Churche are not come to that perfection, nor yet are aminded ſo to doe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5602f25c-b8fe-47e5-a10e-9ba114b50a5e",
                                "sense_id": "6a8a1c75-4e9f-3ce7-aeb7-b0392c2d4177",
                                "text": "For that he was aminded to reuenge the injutie done vnto him, and by force of armes to defend himſelfe: for what elſe had he now left?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1098060a-09de-41be-b54d-dad8beb97994",
                                "sense_id": "6a8a1c75-4e9f-3ce7-aeb7-b0392c2d4177",
                                "text": "Philip King of Macedon, he whom I formerly ſpoke of, […] was aminded to renew the warre; […]"
                            }
                        ]
